    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a card game designed to help you learn Tarot. Throughout the game, you will memorize every element and its symbolic meaning for all 78 cards, aiding your understanding of the fundamental principles of Tarot. The poetic interpretations included in the game have been rewritten by professional Tarot readers to make them easier to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 7 different styles of Tarot decks, and also allows you to customize up to 25 different layouts (spreads).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your imagination and make full use of this game to deepen your Tarot reading skills.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a card game designed to help you learn Tarot. Throughout the game, you will memorize every element and its symbolic meaning for all 78 cards, aiding your understanding of the fundamental principles of Tarot. The poetic interpretations included in the game have been rewritten by professional Tarot readers to make them easier to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 7 different styles of Tarot decks, and also allows you to customize up to 25 different layouts (spreads).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your imagination and make full use of this game to deepen your Tarot reading skills.</p>",
